 "description": "<p>A pink leather collar with a heart-shaped lock accent, fitting 40-50 cm. The lock is the design - it reads as hardware without functioning as one, which is the balance this genre looks for.</p>\n<p>Single colorway, single focal piece. The pink-plus-lock combination runs sweeter than the black hardware versions in the same category.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: leather</li>\n<li>Item type: collar</li>\n<li>Style: heart lock</li>\n<li>Color: pink</li>\n<li>Fit: 40-50 cm circumference</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Adjustable through the standard range. The pink answer to the lock-collar look.</p>\n",
